              </p>
              <p style="text-align:left;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">alle Durchmesser, alle Längen.</span>
               <br/>
               <br/>
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Bauteil(e): </span>
               <TextComplement MarkLbl="61" Kind="Owner">
                <ComplCaption/>
                <ComplBody>
                 <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">&#x27;(&#x3e;Widerlagerwände, Flügelwände, </span>
                 <br/>
                 <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Pfeiler und Kammerwände&#x3c;)&#x27;</span>
                </ComplBody>
